# This repo is PUBLIC — it has to be: jsDelivr only serves public repos, and
# demo.html / demo-inject.js load widget.js from cdn.jsdelivr.net.
#
# So nothing commercial lives here. The whole outreach/ folder (lead data,
# cold email templates, pricing strategy, reply playbook) is local-only — a
# prospect who searches a phrase from one of our emails must not land on our
# playbook. Only what the widget itself needs is tracked.
